---
---

<section id="features" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Built for clean, maintainable frontends</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base text-slate-600">
      Every section is an isolated .astro component with scoped markup, predictable Tailwind tokens, and zero framework lock-in.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500">01</p>
      <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Zero-JS Static Output</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        Compile clean semantic HTML at build time and hydrate interactive islands only when the user scrolls or interacts.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500">02</p>
      <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Cloudflare &amp; Vercel Ready</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        Every repository ships with clean Astro static configuration ready for automated GitHub pushes and edge rollouts.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500">03</p>
      <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Firebase Backend Ready</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        Attach Google Authentication and Cloud Firestore persistence in a single click without maintaining custom auth servers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
